repository-code: "https://github.com/Dojo-1/cryptid-verifier"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean formal reductions and contextual reachability results, with bounded
  numerical experiments. The machine links import the original proofs from
  google-deepmind/cryptids. Non-halting, logarithm laws and global L17 collapse
  remain open.
